<ContentLayout
  title="Geocoding vs. Reverse Geocoding: What Is the Difference? | MyLocationLab"
  description="Compare Forward Geocoding (address to coordinates) with Reverse Geocoding (coordinates to address). Learn spatial indexing, algorithms, and use cases."
  h1="Forward Geocoding vs. Reverse Geocoding: What Is the Difference?"
  subtitle="An architectural breakdown of geospatial translation: converting human addresses to machine coordinates and vice versa."
  section="comparisons"
  sectionLabel="Technical Comparisons"
  readTime="6 min"
